{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32618","headline":"洛阳月夜书怀 · 刘沧","name":"洛阳月夜书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疎柳高槐古巷通，月明西照上阳宫。\n一声边鴈塞门雪，几处远砧河汉风。\n独榻闲眠移岳影，寒窗幽思度烟空。\n孤吟此夕惊秋晚，落叶残花树色中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}